ons computed for all points of `feature_values` for a\n632 |             given feature for all samples in `X`.\n633 |         feature_values : ndarray of shape (n_grid_points,)\n634 |             The feature values for which the predictions have been computed.\n635 |         n_ice_to_plot : int\n636 |             The number of ICE lines to plot.\n637 |         ax : Matplotlib axes\n638 |             The axis on which to plot the ICE lines.\n639 |         pd_plot_idx : int\n640 |             The sequential index of the plot. It will be unraveled to find the\n641 |             matching 2D position in the grid layout.\n642 |         n_total_lines_by_plot : int\n643 |             The total number of lines expected to be plot on the axis.\n644 |         individual_line_kw : dict\n645 |             Dict with keywords passed when plotting the ICE lines.\n646 |         \"\"\"\n647 |         rng = check_random_state(self.random_state)\n648 |         # subsample ice\n649 |         ice_lines_idx = rng.choice(\n650 |             preds.shape[0],\n651 |             n_ice_to_plot,\n652 |             replace=False,\n653 |         )\n654 |         ice_lines_subsampled = preds[ice_lines_idx, :]\n655 |         # plot the subsampled ice\n656 |         for ice_idx, ice in enumerate(ice_lines_subsampled):\n657 |             line_idx = np.unravel_index(\n658 |                 pd_plot_idx * n_total_lines_by_plot + ice_idx, self.lines_.shape\n659 |             )\n660 |             self.lines_[line_idx] = ax.plot(\n661 |                 feature_values, ice.ravel(), **individual_line_kw\n662 |             )[0]\n```\n\nFound function `sklearn/inspection/_plot/partial_dependence.py:PartialDependenceDisplay._plot_average_dependence`.\nSource: Retrieved code content using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n664 | def _plot_average_dependence(\n665 |         self,\n666 |         avg_preds,\n667 |         feature_values,\n668 |         ax,\n669 |         pd_line_idx,\n670 |         line_kw,\n671 |     ):\